{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2022-10-05 16:30:00', 'title': 'DANAHER RELEASES 2022 SUSTAINABILITY REPORT AND ANNOUNCES NEW GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS REDUCTION TARGET', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , OCT. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) (THE "COMPANY"), THE GLOBAL SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY INNOVATOR, TODAY PUBLISHED ITS 2022 SUSTAINABILITY REPORT WHICH HIGHLIGHTS THE PROGRESS OF THE COMPANY\'S SUSTAINABILITY PROGRAM. DANAHER ALSO ANNOUNCED IT HAS SET A NEW GOAL TO REDUCE ITS ABSOLUTE SCOPE 1 AND 2 GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS BY 50.4% BY 2032, COMPARED TO A BASELINE YEAR OF 2021—ALIGNING TO THE PREVAILING CLIMATE SCIENCE GOAL OF LIMITING GLOBAL WARMING TO 1.5 DEGREES CELSIUS ABOVE PRE-INDUSTRIAL LEVELS.'}